{"id": "37096", "title": "真假夫君", "author": "宋雨桐", "category": "文学名著", "count": 22, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37096.htm", "intro": "这究竟见鬼的是怎么回事？他堂堂百世国的洛王爷，\r\n为什么会一觉醒来就被换张脸又换了身体？\r\n还有一个温柔美丽的陌生娘子，柔声唤他“夫君”？\r\n她亲自伺候他沐浴更衣、洗澡擦背不说，\r\n还因为他始终没碰她，而干脆脱光衣服勾引他上床？！\r\n\r\n打从嫁进慕家，不管个性温顺的秦水曼做对做错，\r\n她的夫君总是顺著婆婆的意思，责备她的不是，\r\n可现下……他是在帮她说话吗？是在心疼她吗？\r\n为什么，她老觉得今日的夫君和往昔很不一样呢？\r\n虽然他变得有点怪，可，她却爱极这个样子的夫君呵！", "base": "files/article/html/37/37096", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2910191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(1)", "file": "2910192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(2)", "file": "2910193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(1)", "file": "2910194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(2)", "file": "2910195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(1)", "file": "2910196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(2)", "file": "2910197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(1)", "file": "2910198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(2)", "file": "2910199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(1)", "file": "2910200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(2)", "file": "2910201.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(1)", "file": "2910202.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(2)", "file": "2910203.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(1)", "file": "2910204.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(2)", "file": "2910205.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(1)", "file": "2910206.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(2)", "file": "2910207.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(1)", "file": "2910208.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(2)", "file": "2910209.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(1)", "file": "2910210.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(2)", "file": "2910211.html", "available": true}, {"title": "后记", "file": "2910212.html", "available": true}]}